From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dpvoice: The voice server and client keep a session's state (6064)

DirectPlay Voice answered E_NOTIMPL. The server and client check their
DirectPlay 8 transport and keep the session description, notification
mask and transmit targets, answering with the DVERR codes; no voice is
carried, so a client's Connect finds no voice session. CheckAudioSetup's
query reports that setup has not run, and dpvsetup says the wizard has
nothing to set up.
---
